      "paperId": "1a2c44e8f7439b829956cf8ea1fa70329414fde9",
      "title": "Herder\u2019s Ideas for a Philosophy of Human History (1784-1791), or: the Anthropological De-struction of \u201cAfrica\u201d",
      "authors": [
